19: Class `Texy\HandlerInvocation` is removed: the event system is gone; register a pass with `Texy\Texy::addPass()` or a renderer with `Texy\Output\Html\Config::addRenderer()`, since texy/texy 4.0.
19: Class `Texy\Link` is removed: a link is a `Texy\Nodes\LinkNode` of the document tree, since texy/texy 4.0.
22: Method `Texy\Texy::setOutputMode()` is removed: there is no replacement; the output is always HTML5, since texy/texy 3.1.
22: Constant `Texy\Texy::XHTML1_STRICT` is removed: there is no replacement; XHTML is not generated any more and the output is always HTML5, since texy/texy 3.1.
23: Method `Texy\Texy::getOutputMode()` is removed: there is no replacement; the output is always HTML5, since texy/texy 3.1.
24: Property `Texy\Texy::$encoding` is removed: the input and the output are always UTF-8; drop the setting, since texy/texy 3.0.
25: Property `Texy\Texy::$styleSheet` is removed: there is no replacement; Texy never read the property; keep the stylesheet in a variable of the application, since texy/texy 3.0.
26: Property `Texy\Texy::$xhtml` is removed: there is no replacement; the output is always HTML5; drop the setting, since texy/texy 3.1.
