30: Property `Texy\Modules\HtmlOutputModule::$removeOptional` is removed: optional end tags are never removed; drop the setting, since texy/texy 3.1.
31: Property `Texy\Modules\LinkModule::$popupOnClick` is removed: there is no replacement; pop-up links are not supported, since texy/texy 3.0.
