35: Property `Texy\Texy::$dtd` is removed: the DTD is a static read-only table and can no longer be changed at run time, since texy/texy 3.1.
36: Property `Texy\Texy::$_classes` is removed: the property is private; the allowed classes are configured by `$texy->htmlPolicy->allowedClasses`, since texy/texy 4.0.
37: Property `Texy\Texy::$_styles` is removed: the property is private; the allowed styles are configured by `$texy->htmlPolicy->allowedStyles`, since texy/texy 4.0.
