40: Method `Texy\Modules\LinkModule::solveUrlEmail()` is removed: work with the nodes in a pass registered by `Texy\Texy::addPass()` or a renderer registered by `Texy\Output\Html\Config::addRenderer()`, since texy/texy 4.0.
41: Method `Texy\Modules\HtmlOutputModule::postProcess()` is removed: work with the nodes in a pass registered by `Texy\Texy::addPass()` or a renderer registered by `Texy\Output\Html\Config::addRenderer()`, since texy/texy 4.0.
