47: Property `Texy\Modules\ImageModule::$defaultAlt` is removed: there is no replacement, since texy/texy 3.2.8.
48: Property `Texy\Modules\ImageModule::$linkedRoot` is removed: there is no replacement, since texy/texy 3.2.8.
