161: Method `Texy\Texy::registerLinePattern()` is removed: call `addInlineSyntax($name, $pattern, $parser)`, whose parser gets a `Texy\Parsing\ParseContext` and returns a node, since texy/texy 4.0.
162: Method `Texy\Texy::registerBlockPattern()` is removed: call `addBlockSyntax($name, $pattern, $parser)`, whose parser gets a `Texy\Parsing\ParseContext` and returns a node, since texy/texy 4.0.
163: Method `Texy\Texy::registerPostLine()` is removed: register a pass over the document with `addPass()`, since texy/texy 4.0.
164: Method `Texy\Texy::addHandler()` is removed: the event system is gone; register a pass with `addPass()` or a renderer with `Texy\Output\Html\Config::addRenderer()`, since texy/texy 4.0.
