166: Method `Texy\Texy::getDOM()` is removed: call `parse()`, which returns the document tree, since texy/texy 4.0.
167: Method `Texy\Texy::protect()` is removed: return a `Texy\Output\Html\Element` or `Texy\Output\Html\Raw` from a renderer, since texy/texy 4.0.
167: Constant `Texy\Texy::CONTENT_MARKUP` is removed: there is no replacement; the protection marks are gone, since texy/texy 4.0.
168: Property `Texy\Modules\ImageModule::$root` is removed: use `$texy->htmlOutput->imageBaseUrl`, since texy/texy 4.0.
169: Property `Texy\Modules\ImageModule::$leftClass` is removed: use `$texy->htmlOutput->floatClasses['left']`, one class for images and figures, since texy/texy 4.0.
